sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Browser
    participant SK as SvelteKit server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    User->>UI: Submit subject, category, description
    UI->>SK: Form submission
    SK->>SK: Verify session and validate fields
    SK->>DB: Begin transaction
    SK->>DB: Insert ticket
    SK->>DB: Insert ticket-created event
    SK->>DB: Commit transaction
    DB-->>SK: Ticket ID / number
    SK-->>UI: Redirect to ticket detail
    UI-->>User: Show created ticket
